    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper used by class <ref refid="structllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instr_desc" kindref="compound">InstrDesc</ref> to describe how hardware resources are used. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes how many resource units of a specific resource kind (and how many cycles) are &quot;used&quot; by an instruction. </para>
